            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New
- **Your last message above the terminal.** The line above a task's terminal starts with what you last wrote to the agent. Click it to find it in the terminal; each further click goes one occurrence back, and a message that is no longer on screen opens in a popover. Turn it off in Settings > Terminal > Show Your Last Message.
- **macOS editing keys in the terminal.** ⌥⌫ deletes a word, ⌘⌫ the line, ⌥← ⌥→ jump by word, ⌘← ⌘→ go to the start or end of the line. Turn it off in Settings > Terminal > macOS Text Editing Keys.

### Fixed
- Characters your keyboard layout types with Option, such as `|`, `$`, `@`, `#` and `[ ]` on Turkish or German layouts, are typed in the terminal again while Use Option as Meta is on.
]]></description>
